        "en": "True or false?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "False"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "True"
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionId": "a",
      "explanation": {
        "he": "בקטע כתוב: nobody believed it would work. כלומר אף אחד לא האמין.",
        "en": "The text says: nobody believed it would work."
      },
      "hints": [
        {
          "he": "לחפש את המילה believed בקטע.",
          "en": "Look for the word believed in the text."
        }
      ],
      "source": "original",
      "estimatedTimeSec": 25,
      "passageId": "passage.school-garden"
    },
    {
      "id": "read.garden.give-up",
      "type": "choice",
      "skill": "reading.vocabulary-in-context",
      "level": "A2",
      "difficulty": 0.5,
      "prompt": "In the text, \"did not give up\" means the students...",
      "instruction": {
        "he": "לבחור את התשובה הנכונה",
        "en": "Choose the correct answer"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "kept trying"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "gave a present"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "woke up early"
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionId": "a",
      "explanation": {
        "he": "give up = לוותר. did not give up = לא ויתרו, המשיכו לנסות.",
        "en": "give up = stop trying. did not give up = kept trying."
      },
      "hints": [
        {
          "he": "מה התלמידים עשו אחרי שהקרקע הייתה יבשה?",
          "en": "What did the students do after they saw the dry ground?"
        }
      ],
      "source": "original",
      "estimatedTimeSec": 25,
      "passageId": "passage.school-garden"
    },
    {
      "id": "read.garden.main-idea",
      "type": "choice",
      "skill": "reading.main-idea",
      "level": "B1",
      "difficulty": 0.4,
      "prompt": "What is the main idea of the text?",
      "instruction": {
        "he": "לבחור את התשובה הנכונה",
        "en": "Choose the correct answer"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "Students turned a difficult place into a successful garden."
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "Tomatoes need a lot of water to grow."
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "The school cafeteria makes good salads."
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionId": "a",
      "explanation": {
        "he": "הרעיון המרכזי מתאר את כל הקטע, לא פרט אחד ממנו.",
        "en": "The main idea covers the whole text, not one detail."
      },
      "hints": [
        {
          "he": "איזו תשובה מתארת את כל הסיפור ולא רק חלק ממנו?",
          "en": "Which answer describes the whole story?"
        }
      ],
      "source": "original",
      "estimatedTimeSec": 30,
      "passageId": "passage.school-garden"
    },
    {
      "id": "read.garden.inference",
      "type": "choice",
      "skill": "reading.inference",
      "level": "B1",
      "difficulty": 0.6,
      "prompt": "Why did the students choose herbs that do not need much water?",
      "instruction": {
        "he": "לבחור את התשובה הנכונה",
        "en": "Choose the correct answer"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "Because the ground was dry and water was limited."
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "Because herbs are cheaper than vegetables."
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "Because their teacher told them to."
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionId": "a",
      "explanation": {
        "he": "זה לא כתוב במפורש. מסיקים זאת מכך שהקרקע הייתה יבשה ושהם אספו מי גשם.",
        "en": "It is not written directly. We infer it from the dry ground and the rainwater."
      },
      "hints": [
        {
          "he": "מה הקטע אומר על הקרקע?",
          "en": "What does the text say about the ground?"
        },
        {
          "he": "למה צריך לאסוף מי גשם?",
          "en": "Why would you collect rainwater?"
        }
      ],
      "source": "original",
      "estimatedTimeSec": 35,
      "passageId": "passage.school-garden"
    },
